title: Start
---
<<declare $gold = 12>>
Ada: You carry {$gold} coins, and {$gold + 3} more in the purse. #line:4a0001
Ada: [wave]Hello[/wave], traveller. #line:4a0002
Ada: Escaped \[not markup\] here. #line:4a0003
Ada: Count {$gold} while [bold color="red"]this[/bold] glows. #line:4a0004
Ada: A bare [ bracket is not markup. #line:4a0005
Ada: An unclosed [wave tag stays prose. #line:4a0006
Ada: Plain text with nothing special. #line:4a0007
Ada: Markup in a "quoted [wave] span" still counts. #line:4a0008
===
